flowchart TD
  A([Student misses lessons or tasks]) --> B[System lists missed lessons and tasks]
  B --> C[Order items by skill prerequisites]
  C --> D[Read student's available days and teacher deadline]
  D --> E[Spread items across available days]
  E --> F{Fits before deadline?}
  F -- No --> G[Flag plan for teacher with overload warning]
  F -- Yes --> H[Draft plan sent to teacher]
  G --> H
  H --> I{Teacher approves?}
  I -- Edit --> J[Teacher changes items or deadline] --> E
  I -- Yes --> K[Plan published to student and parent]
  K --> L[Student completes items]
  L --> M{All items done?}
  M -- No, item overdue --> N[Support alert raised] --> L
  M -- Yes --> O([Plan completed, skill map updated])
